docs {
  # Get Appearance Sidebar
  
  Sidebar module layout moved next to Appearance in #201 (`sidebar_modules`).
  
  **Method:** GET  
  **Endpoint:** `{{base_url}}/settings/appearance/sidebar`  
  **Route name:** `appearance.sidebar.edit`  
  **Permission:** `CanManageProjectSettings`
  
  Other section GETs (localization, security, content, files) follow the same pattern under `/settings/project/{section}` — not duplicated here to keep the collection lean; see folder docs for the full map.
}
